     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Dovunque and ovunque",
     "texto": [
      "**Dovunque vada** (wherever he/she goes), **ovunque sia** (wherever he/she is).",
      "Both are synonyms. They take the present subjunctive."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comunque and qualsiasi",
     "texto": [
      "**Comunque vada** (whatever happens), **qualsiasi cosa** (anything), **qualunque cosa** (anything).",
      "**Comunque** can also mean «anyway»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
